            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ROBINBRADY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Sauteed the veggies and ham in some butter before adding the broth. Increased the barley to one cup and cooked only until the barley was done. Delicious and makes lots of servings. Very economical.",
            "datePublished": "2010-01-13T17:12:31.377Z"
